---
---
<section data-animate class="py-14 px-10 text-center bg-cream relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Hoja decorativa izquierda -->
  <div class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-10 -translate-x-4" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg width="80" height="120" viewBox="0 0 80 120" fill="none">
      <path d="M40 110 Q5 75 15 15 Q50 5 70 40 Q65 80 40 110Z" fill="#6b8a50"/>
      <path d="M40 110 L40 15" stroke="#2d3d20" stroke-width="1" fill="none"/>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <!-- Hoja decorativa derecha -->
  <div class="absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-10 translate-x-4 scale-x-[-1]" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg width="80" height="120" viewBox="0 0 80 120" fill="none">
      <path d="M40 110 Q5 75 15 15 Q50 5 70 40 Q65 80 40 110Z" fill="#6b8a50"/>
      <path d="M40 110 L40 15" stroke="#2d3d20" stroke-width="1" fill="none"/>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-sm mx-auto">
    <p class="font-serif italic text-bot-dark text-lg leading-loose mb-8">
      Con el amor que nos une, la bendición de Dios y el apoyo de nuestros padres, te invitamos a celebrar el día más especial de nuestras vidas.
    </p>

    <div class="w-10 border-t border-bot-mid mx-auto mb-8"></div>

    <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase text-bot-mid mb-5">Hijos de</p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-bot-dark tracking-wide mb-1">Familia Lemaire</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-bot-mid/70 font-serif italic leading-relaxed">
          Jean-Pierre<br/>& Marie Lemaire
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-bot-dark tracking-wide mb-1">Familia Dubois</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-bot-mid/70 font-serif italic leading-relaxed">
          Henri<br/>& Claire Dubois
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
